      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "86043887262011****",
      "help_en": "The unique identifier of the Data Studio node.\n\nThis field is of type Long in SDK versions prior to 8.0.0, and of type String in SDK version 8.0.0 and later. This change does not affect the normal use of the SDK; parameters are still returned according to the type defined in the SDK. Compilation failures due to the type change may occur only when upgrading the SDK across version 8.0.0, in which case users need to manually correct the data type",
      "help_zh": "数据开发节点的唯一标识符。\n\n<notice>该字段在SDK8.0.0版本之前为Long类型，SDK8.0.0版本及之后为String类型。该变更不影响SDK正常使用，参数仍会按SDK中定义的类型返回。只有在跨8.0.0版本的SDK升级时，类型变更可能会导致项目编译不通过，需要用户手动修正数据类型。></notice>",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "id",
      "options": [
        "--id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Id",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
